                     "contentNotes":  [
                                          "The module assembly embeds worldgen/templates/cultures/*.json, which carry about 1,051 name and lore strings with their localisation ids copied from the game\u0027s culture definitions (spcultures.xml), 7 of them culture lore paragraphs. They are not game files, but they are copied official text; whether to resolve them from the player\u0027s installation instead is an open decision (MMR-57)."
                                      ],
