                                              "generated scenes (SceneObj/), made at run time in the installed module folder",
                                              "the surface template\u0027s scene.xscene and atmosphere.xml (derived from the installed SandBoxCore battle_terrain_001 on the player\u0027s machine) and its empty flora.bin (written there)"
